<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bill changes could lead to tax hikes - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bill changes could lead to tax hikes - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday the government could be forced to raise taxes or increase borrowings as a result of the Senate's substantial amendment to social security budget legislation late on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
